        "id": 18914
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-04-21T19:11:19Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yeah that makes sense. My thinking was that pre-allocating room for more elements than we may end up needing would be suboptimal, but it\u0027s a 1 v. 2 item difference and I see the value of doing it that way. Used `Pipeline::kNumUniformBuffers` instead of `2` to avoid magic (even if simple) number.",
      "parentUuid": "de26f492_b446e52d",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 1421,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 1421,
        "endChar": 62
